{"title":"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/e/13e70ef329c8d112bcfaf0a073ca33164cc042e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(487,000)(12,027,300)+(9,621,001)(487,000)}{(19,367)(.05)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"375\" height=\"43\" /> is closest to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/2/a629bc0f3efdeb3e08dabbc074c0069fd2f38da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 10,000,000 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 100,000,000 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 1,000,000,000 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 10,000,000,000 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 100,000,000,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"847\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can make the approximations\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/a/68a90bb466761ee4ff12535b680c5a85d99f2286.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 487,000 &amp;\\approx 500,000 \\\\  12,027,300 &amp;\\approx 12,000,000 \\\\ 9,621,001 &amp;\\approx 10,000,000 \\\\ 19,367 &amp;\\approx 20,000. \\end{align*}\" width=\"199\" height=\"91\" />\n</p><p>Using these instead of the original numbers for an estimate, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09d6ab29ebe43a8f72536a4f5cc70bb76c92fb97.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{(500,000)(12,000,000)+(10,000,000)(500,000)}{(20000)(.05)} &amp;= \\frac{500,000\\times 22,000,000}{1000} \\\\ &amp;= 500,000 \\times 22,000 \\\\ &amp;= 1.1\\times 10^{10} \\\\ &amp;\\approx 10,000,000,000 \\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{D}}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"588\" height=\"126\" />\n</p><p><br />\n~*If you typed this into a calculator or actually got the answer, it would be AROUND 10 billion.*~\n</p><p>~*Calypso*~\n</p><p>\"Google says the answer is 10,887,305,816.1\" ~ xxsc\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME\" title=\"1991 AJHSME\">1991 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:cen